{"id":9566334320808,"title":"Bracken Lower Back Support Belt","handle":"lower-back-support","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for the people whose backs do the heavy lifting.\u003c\/strong\u003e Nurses, drivers, warehouse crews, and anyone on their feet through a long shift. The dual-strap design gives you adjustable compression you control, and the removable lumbar pad sits right where you want support most.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Bracken\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDual-strap compression\u003c\/strong\u003e — tighten or loosen in seconds, even mid-shift\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRemovable contoured lumbar pad\u003c\/strong\u003e for targeted lower-back support\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBreathable fabric\u003c\/strong\u003e that won't trap heat during a 12-hour day\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSlim profile\u003c\/strong\u003e — wear it discreetly under scrubs, a uniform, or a t-shirt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFind your size\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeasure around your waist at belly-button level (not your pant size). The belt is highly adjustable — if you're between sizes, size up.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSize\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eWaist (inches)\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eWaist (cm)\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eS\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e26 – 31\"\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e65 – 80\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eM\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e31.5 – 39\"\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e80 – 100\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eL\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e35.5 – 43\"\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e90 – 110\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eXL\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e39.5 – 47\"\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e100 – 120\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eXXL\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e47 – 55\"\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e120 – 140\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eXXXL\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e53 – 61\"\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e135 – 155\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eRisk-free\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e60-day money-back guarantee\u003c\/strong\u003e — if it's not right for you, send it back.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFree tracked shipping\u003c\/strong\u003e on every order, with tracking emailed as soon as it ships.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eBracken support belts are comfort and support products, not medical devices. If you have an injury or an ongoing back condition, check with your healthcare provider.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-08-13T02:06:09-04:00","created_at":"2026-08-13T02:06:04-04:00","vendor":"Bracken","type":"Back Support Belt","tags":[],"price":4999,"price_min":4999,"price_max":4999,"available":true,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":0,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variants":[{"id":55867110949032,"title":"S (26–31\" waist)","option1":"S (26–31\" waist)","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"1488b9fa-9f59-40bd-a5a5-00d17fb2382e","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"name":"Bracken Lower Back Support Belt - S (26–31\" waist)","public_title":"S (26–31\" waist)","options":["S (26–31\" waist)"],"price":4999,"weight":470,"compare_at_price":0,"inventory_management":"shopify","barcode":"705353750069","quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"quantity_price_breaks":[],"requires_selling_plan":false,"selling_plan_allocations":[]},{"id":55867111047336,"title":"M (31.5